ound","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A vigilant Lich, one of the many custodians of the Temple of Knowledge. His threads entwine with the sparks in the Soul Furnace, rescuing unwitting wanderers and punishing trespassers.","abilities":["Stops attacking and starts channeling to create Marks of Epoch around the Objective."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":600,"def":350,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"mudrock_colossus":{"slug":"mudrock_colossus","name":"Mudrock Colossus","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mudrock Colossus.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Arts Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"This Originium construct, crafted by Mudrock, does not possess sentience and must be directly controlled by Mudrock. Though bulky and slow, they are extremely durable and boast terrifying physical damage and survivability.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.4,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":3000,"def":700,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":7}},"fremont_enlightener_of_minds":{"slug":"fremont_enlightener_of_minds","name":"Fremont, Enlightener of Minds","icon":"/enemies-icons/Fremont, Enlightener of Minds.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Leader of the Liches, high arbiter of civil disputes in Kazdel, and above all, an ageless teacher. He does not approve of your dangerous actions within the furnace, and intervenes purely for your own good.","abilities":["First Form","[Improvised Defense] Gains 1 Attack Energy charge periodically, up to 3 charges. Each charge reduces Physical and Arts damage taken. The next attack expends all charges.","['Sarcophagus of Exile'] When Fremont, Enlightener of Minds is on th